  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Fca Us reported $512M in total contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Fca Us received 11,836 awards so far in the fiscal year, with an average award size of $43.3K. Fca Us obligations are up 101.5% year over year in the current reporting period. Fca Us posted obligations across multiple fiscal years: FY21 $267M, FY22 $16.1M, FY23 $356M, FY24 $330M, FY25 $254M, and FY26 $512M. Fca Us figures cover contract obligations except for award-value figures in the largest-awards and expiring-contracts tables, which are total contract values. Fca Us current-year totals are partial and represent fiscal year to date activity. This snapshot summarizes award count, average award size, year-over-year change, and a six-year series of obligations for readers tracking federal vendor performance.",
